  "name": "Track expiring federal contracts and recompetes in Google Sheets",
  "tags": [],
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "b44c3cd8-afc7-4b73-bccb-43b380ecbda5",
      "name": "Overview and setup",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -560,
        -380
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 480,
        "height": 820,
        "content": "## Track expiring federal contracts and recompetes in Google Sheets\n\n### Who it's for\nGovCon capture managers and BD teams who plan bids around contracts that are about to expire.\n\n### How it works\n1. **Schedule** fires Mondays at 7:00.\n2. **Run GovCon Recompete Radar** finds federal contracts ending in 3-18 months (USAspending.gov), joined to open SAM.gov notices with a match confidence. Only new or changed rows (`monitorName`).\n3. **Has contracts?** stops on empty weeks.\n4. **Pick columns** keeps 22 fields.\n5. **Append or update in Google Sheets** matches on `id`.\n\n### How to set up\n1. Get your Apify API token: Apify Console > Settings > API & Integrations.\n2. In *Run GovCon Recompete Radar*, create a **Header Auth** credential: Name `Authorization`, Value `Bearer YOUR_APIFY_TOKEN`. Never paste the token into the URL or body.\n3. Connect your **Google Sheets** credential, paste your spreadsheet ID, and put the 22 column names from *Pick columns* in row 1.\n4. Run once manually, check the output, then activate.\n\n### Customize the input\nEdit the JSON body of *Run GovCon Recompete Radar*: `naicsCodes`, `awardingAgencies`, `minAwardAmount`, `monthsFrom`/`monthsTo`, `maxItems`. Keep `monitorName` fixed.\n\n### Requirements\nApify, pay per result: $0.01 per run + $0.01 per contract row.\nActor: https://apify.com/cce_partners/govcon-recompete-radar\n\n### How to extend\nAdd a Slack alert for high-confidence matches, or filter on agency or award size."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "c37f37d4-8745-4a07-8235-a6ff3039aae6",
      "name": "Step 1: Schedule",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -60,
        -200
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 5,
        "width": 220,
        "height": 180,
        "content": "### 1. Schedule\nChange the cron/interval here. Runs once per period; the Actor itself skips anything already sent."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "6eacc3b3-e02f-47ba-a78d-3b669be97c89",
      "name": "Step 2: Run the Actor",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        180,
        -260
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 5,
        "width": 280,
        "height": 240,
        "content": "### 2. Run GovCon Recompete Radar on Apify\nPOST to run-sync-get-dataset-items with your filters in the JSON body. Auth: your Header Auth credential (`Authorization: Bearer <token>`). Timeout 300 s."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "fa7211e4-70b4-4e1d-8175-ccb958109a61",
      "name": "Step 3: Deliver",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        460,
        -300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 5,
        "width": 600,
        "height": 260,
        "content": "### 3. Filter and deliver to Google Sheets\n*Has contracts?* stops when there's nothing new. Then the results go to Google Sheets. Set your own credential and target (sheet ID / channel) on the last node."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
